            <div class="anywhere__head">
              <p class="tag">[09] Anywhere</p>
              <h2 id="anywhere-title" class="h2" data-reveal>On your machine. Reachable from anywhere.</h2>
              <p class="body" data-reveal>
                Astrolabe runs as a small server on the computer where your code lives. Open it in the
                desktop app or a browser, or on your iPhone, where Threads, Changes, Wikis and
                Repositories each have a tab. Reach it over your own network, Tailscale, or Remote access.
              </p>
